# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every OS. Generated files (openapi.json,
# tokens.css) are compared byte for byte in tests, and Prettier expects LF, so a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true must not turn them into CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.bundle binary
